{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你猜我撑多久？我撑了十一秒，你猜我还能撑多久。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.731, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "这一秒够不够？我这一秒够你讨个奖，你愿意吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.743, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第二句破音，别夸。唱得不好，不如先唱好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.573, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 203, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "下一句，先唱起开头。唱得不好，就唱起结尾。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.713, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 271, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。我留给你，你留给我。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.581, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我留给你，你留给我。我留给你，你留给我。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.64, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 272, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台要管柜台，我负责送包裹。柜台上放云箱，柜员送云。柜员说，云箱要寄到云。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.768, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 53, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 221, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "柜员先帮柜主把云箱装好，柜员再给柜主送云。柜员说，云箱要寄到云，柜员先帮柜主把云箱装好。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.036, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 65, "prompt_tokens": 252, "total_tokens": 317, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，先跟车。我刚才喊左转，你急得把方向盘甩了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.623, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先跟车。我刚才喊左转，你急得把方向盘甩了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.659, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "说不上，我猜你下班后想给老板发个“今天没吃午饭，却把鱼都吃光了”的纸条。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.726, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板说请假的，我这就去。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.444, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 17, "prompt_tokens": 245, "total_tokens": 262, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "扣子太小，连你都没注意到。下次加个更大的，别指望别人注意。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.599, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 205, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "扣子太小，别指望别人注意。下次加个更大的，别指望别人注意。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.688, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 275, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别累啦，先给你讲个笑话。我刚才把鱼尾巴折了，尾巴还能动，你猜它想干嘛？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.709, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "别划水，我在这儿，你坐我旁边。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.636, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 242, "total_tokens": 276, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
